    "optimizedContext": {
      "value": "# MaterializeSpecMetadata\n## Rules\n- `if-needed`: return fresh persisted metadata; otherwise generate then guarded persist.\n- `force`: always generate/persist. Conflict rereads winner then retries once.\n- Cache-write failure in if-needed returns generated metadata plus warning.\n## Constraints\n- Sole metadata freshness/regeneration orchestrator.\n- No self-derived schema/options; max one retry.",
